      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 30,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "As for me, I said in my prosperity, “I shall never be moved.”",
      "ko": "내가 형통할 때에 말하기를 영영히 요동치 아니하리라 하였도다",
      "source_text_hash": "8e5aa6cec1960266edb09e75e1aa3493ad78e504292ebcd2e976f005bff17ba7",
      "translation_text_hash": "c5529f7c44116325e34fd62aba30835593a8a8e17c237ff3621b54953f287836",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "내가 형통할 때에 말하기를 영영히 요동치 아니하리라 하였도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "c5529f7c44116325e34fd62aba30835593a8a8e17c237ff3621b54953f287836"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:30:7",
      "sequence": 14327,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 30",
      "verse_label": "7",
      "locator": {
        "book": "PSA",
